	/// conditions:
	///
	/// - is not a recursive descent (`..`)
	/// - contains a single selector
	/// - that selector is either an index selector or a name selector
	///
	/// For example, `$['foo'][1]` is a singular path.  Shorthand syntax (e.g. `$.foo[1]`)
	/// is also allowed.
	/// </remarks>
